<title>USA: TABLE - Valspar Corp Q3 net, sales rise.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Valspar Corp Q3 net, sales rise.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Third Quarter		Year-to-Date</p>
<p>			   1997	 1996	  1997	  1996</p>
<p> Net Sales	 $282,655    $247,481    $724,711    $621,244</p>
<p> Cost of Sales    194,000     171,516     499,809     435,839</p>
<p>Operating Expenses</p>
<p>			 54,411	45,153     147,700     120,230</p>
<p> Operating Profit  34,244	30,812	77,202	65,175</p>
<p> Interest Expense   1,711	 1,050	 3,627	 2,216</p>
<p>Other Income - Net</p>
<p>			  2,030	   663	 2,840	 1,527</p>
<p>Income Before</p>
<p>  Income Taxes     34,563	30,425	76,415	64,486</p>
<p> Income Taxes	13,895	12,231	30,716	25,923</p>
<p> Net Income	  20,668	18,194	45,699	38,563</p>
<p>Net Income per</p>
<p>  Common Share	 0.47	  0.41	  1.03	  0.87</p>
<p>Avg Number of</p>
<p>  Shares O/S   44,225,060  44,453,968  44,232,548  44,425,368</p>
<p>NOTE: Periods ended July 25 vs July 26.</p>
<p>Per share results adjusted for two-for-one stock split paid March 21, 1997.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312 408 8787))</p>
